O(Gs,A-)\:ff1aSun\:3089\:306e\:8ad6\:6587\:3088\:308a\:3001\:6307\:6a19 \
\"Gs\" \:3068 \"A-\" \:306e\:5b9a\:7fa9\:ff1a
Gs = 1 - ((2 [n*c1 + (n-1)*c2 + ...] - C) / (C*n)); n:age, c:year cited, \
C:total cited;
A = \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]A-\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] + \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]A+\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote];
B : year accumulation (normarized).
